    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ただし営業時間は、きっちり定時まで。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方、マグを二つ持って受付をのぞくと、彼女は今日の最後の作業をしていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "修理じゃ、ない。廃材の歯車と配線で、何かを組んでいる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それ、何の修理ですか?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "修理では、ありません。……製作です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "用途も効率もありません。強いて言えば——好みです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "teirei.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "完成したのは、機械の花だった。歯車の花びら、配線の茎、そして中心に、琥珀色の小さな灯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕暮れの受付台で、それは何の役にも立たず、ただ、きれいに灯っていた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "兵器だった頃の私は、必要なものしか、作れませんでした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……これは、私が作った、最初の「必要のないもの」です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……必要ですよ。少なくとも私は今、この灯りのそばでお茶が飲みたいです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マグを二つ、受付台に置く。60.0度が二つ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "機械花の琥珀灯を挟んで、夕方の定時後が、ゆっくり流れる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女の首が、満足の十五度に傾いた。私の耳も、つられて、へにゃっと下がる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "柿落としの出演届を、提出済みです。演目「機械花の点灯式(実用性、ゼロ)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "備考——「照準は、花にだけ合わせます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "実用性ゼロを、堂々と演目にする元兵器。好みの一覧は、今日で何号まで増えただろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "理由欄は、きっと全部、空欄のまま提出されている。それでいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "teirei.epilogue.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それがいい。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "teirei.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
